dhcpc (2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * A clock step no longer ends a lease early. The lease is timed from
    when the request was sent, by time since the system started.
  * A lease that can't be renewed ends on time. A T1 at or past the
    lease's end is taken as half the lease.
  * A lease the leasing server refuses ends at once. Before T2, a
    refusal from any other server is ignored. A refused first request
    starts over at once. A second refusal ends the try.

